<BaseLayout
  title="Speculative Decoding Scaling Laws: The 200× Rule | Catpuccino.ai"
  description="Before training a single draft model, you can predict the optimal size: it should be ~200× smaller than the target. SDSL derives this analytically from pre-training scaling laws."
